msgid "When you decide to import the EPG after the box booted mention if the \\\\"
msgstr "Când decideți să importați EPG-ul după pornirea casetei, menționați dacă \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"

msgid "When you restart the GUI you can decide to skip or not the EPG data import."
msgstr "Când reporniți GUI, puteți decide să omiteți sau nu importarea datelor EPG."

msgid "Write to /tmp/epgimport.log"
msgstr "Scrieți în /tmp/epgimport.log"

msgid "You can select the day(s) when the EPG update must be performed."
msgstr "Puteți selecta ziua (zile) în care trebuie efectuată actualizarea EPG."

msgid "You can start automatically the plugin AutoTimer after the EPG data update to have it refreshing its scheduling after EPG data refresh."
msgstr "Puteți porni automat pluginul AutoTimer după actualizarea datelor EPG pentru a-l reîmprospăta programarea după reîmprospătarea datelor EPG."

